{"folioDeck":1,"exportedAt":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z","meta":{"id":"ruabc","title":"Russian Alphabet","subtitle":"33 letters · both directions, as two cards per letter","desc":"The 33 letters of the Russian alphabet, in alphabetical order — the first deck of the Russian collection, since the word decks are written in Cyrillic from their first card and carry no transliteration. Both directions: see a letter and recall its sound, or see a sound and recall the letter, each a card with its own schedule. Every note gives the letter in capital and small, its name (what a Russian calls it when spelling a word aloud) with a speaker, its sounds in the International Phonetic Alphabet, the English sound it comes nearest to, and one word of the TORFL A1 deck that shows it, with that word's stress, its own transcription and a speaker. A letter stands for more than one sound (а is [a] under the stress and [ɐ] elsewhere; most consonants are hard or soft): this deck gives each letter's sounds, and the deck beside it, Russian — Sounds and spelling, says which is read where. At the default of ten new cards a day, both directions together, the 33 letters take 7 days. — WHAT IS NOT HERE: nothing on these cards was written for this deck. The name, the sounds and the English equivalent are the three cells of the Letters table of the page named below, as it gives them (ъ and ь are described there rather than compared); the speaker is your device's Russian voice, so a device without one is silent. — Names, sounds and English equivalents: Wikipedia, “Russian alphabet”, revision 1381885718 of 2026-10-25 (CC BY-SA 4.0). Transcriptions: English Wiktionary, via kaikki.org (CC BY-SA 4.0). Example words, stress and meanings: the TORFL A1 deck on this shelf (English Wiktionary via kaikki.org, CC BY-SA 4.0).","author":"","language":"en","color":"#2E5C9A","tags":["russian","alphabet","cyrillic"],"glossMode":"site","types":{"ru-abc":{"id":"ru-abc","name":"Russian letter","speechLang":"ru-RU","fields":["Letter","Name","Sound","Example","Word"],"cards":[{"name":"Letter → sound","front":"<div class=\"uc-letter\">{{Letter}}<span class=\"uc-tts uc-say\" data-say=\"{{Name}}\"></span></div>","back":"{{FrontSide}}<hr><div class=\"uc-field\"><div class=\"uc-pos\">name</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Name}}</div><div class=\"uc-pos uc-gap\">sound</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Sound}}</div><div class=\"uc-pos uc-gap\">as in</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Example}}<span class=\"uc-tts uc-say\" data-say=\"{{Word}}\"></span></div></div>"},{"name":"Sound → letter","front":"<div class=\"uc-ask\">Which letter is this?</div><div class=\"uc-field\"><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Sound}}</div></div>","back":"{{FrontSide}}<hr><div class=\"uc-letter\">{{Letter}}<span class=\"uc-tts uc-say\" data-say=\"{{Name}}\"></span></div><div class=\"uc-field\"><div class=\"uc-pos\">name</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Name}}</div><div class=\"uc-pos uc-gap\">sound</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Sound}}</div><div class=\"uc-pos uc-gap\">as in</div><div class=\"uc-gl\">{{Example}}<span class=\"uc-tts uc-say\" data-say=\"{{Word}}\"></span></div></div>"}],"css":".card {\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 17px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n.uc-ask {\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  opacity: 0.55;\n}\n.uc-letter {\n  font-size: 64px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n}\n.uc-say {\n  margin-left: 14px;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n.uc-field {\n  display: block;\n  width: fit-content;\n  min-width: min(300px, 100%);\n  max-width: 100%;\n  margin: 14px auto 0;\n  padding: 11px 15px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--rule, rgba(0,0,0,0.12));\n  border-radius: 11px;\n  text-align: left;\n  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper-2, #EFEDE6) 58%, var(--card, #FFFFFF));\n}\n.uc-pos {\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n  font-size: 9.5px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--ink-faint, #6C6A63);\n}\n.uc-gap {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n}\n.uc-gl {\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.uc-ipa, .uc-ri {\n  margin-right: 9px;\n  color: var(--accent, #B4532A);\n}\n.uc-like b {\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: var(--accent, #B4532A);\n}\n.uc-ex {\n  margin-right: 9px;\n  font-size: 19px;\n}\n.uc-exe {\n  opacity: 0.62;\n}\n"}},"version":2,"createdAt":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z","forkedFrom":null},"cards":[{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"А а","Name":"а","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[a], [ɐ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">f<b>a</b>ther</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">ма́ма</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈmamə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">mum, mother</span>","Word":"мама"},"id":"u_ruabc_1","type":"ru-abc","key":"А а"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Б б","Name":"бэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[b] or [bʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>b</b>ad</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">брат</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[brat]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">brother</span>","Word":"брат"},"id":"u_ruabc_2","type":"ru-abc","key":"Б б"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"В в","Name":"вэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[v] or [vʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>v</b>ine</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">вода́</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[vɐˈda]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">water</span>","Word":"вода"},"id":"u_ruabc_3","type":"ru-abc","key":"В в"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Г г","Name":"гэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ɡ] or [gʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>g</b>o</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">го́род</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈɡorət]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">city, town</span>","Word":"город"},"id":"u_ruabc_4","type":"ru-abc","key":"Г г"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Д д","Name":"дэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[d] or [dʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>d</b>o</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">дом</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[dom]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">house, building (a residential building)</span>","Word":"дом"},"id":"u_ruabc_5","type":"ru-abc","key":"Д д"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Е е","Name":"е","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[je], [ʲe] or [e]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>ye</b>s</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">есть</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[jesʲtʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">to eat</span>","Word":"есть"},"id":"u_ruabc_6","type":"ru-abc","key":"Е е"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ё ё","Name":"ё","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[jo] or [ʲo]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>yo</b>gurt</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">её</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[(j)ɪˈjɵ]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">her, its</span>","Word":"её"},"id":"u_ruabc_7","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ё ё"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ж ж","Name":"жэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ʐ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">mea<b>s</b>ure</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">жена́</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ʐɨˈna]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">wife</span>","Word":"жена"},"id":"u_ruabc_8","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ж ж"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"З з","Name":"зэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[z] or [zʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>z</b>oo</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">зима́</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[zʲɪˈma]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">winter</span>","Word":"зима"},"id":"u_ruabc_9","type":"ru-abc","key":"З з"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"И и","Name":"и","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[i], [ʲi], or [ɨ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">pol<b>i</b>ce</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">и́мя</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈimʲə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">name, first name</span>","Word":"имя"},"id":"u_ruabc_10","type":"ru-abc","key":"И и"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Й й","Name":"и краткое","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[j]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>y</b>ou or to<b>y</b></span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">мой</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[moj]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">my, mine</span>","Word":"мой"},"id":"u_ruabc_11","type":"ru-abc","key":"Й й"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"К к","Name":"ка","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[k] or [kʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>k</b>ept</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">кни́га</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈknʲiɡə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">book</span>","Word":"книга"},"id":"u_ruabc_12","type":"ru-abc","key":"К к"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Л л","Name":"эль","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ɫ] or [lʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">fee<b>l</b> or <b>l</b>amp</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">ле́то</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈlʲetə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">summer</span>","Word":"лето"},"id":"u_ruabc_13","type":"ru-abc","key":"Л л"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"М м","Name":"эм","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[m] or [mʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>m</b>ap</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">молоко́</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[məɫɐˈko]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">milk</span>","Word":"молоко"},"id":"u_ruabc_14","type":"ru-abc","key":"М м"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Н н","Name":"эн","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[n] or [nʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>n</b>ot</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">нет</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[nʲet]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">no</span>","Word":"нет"},"id":"u_ruabc_15","type":"ru-abc","key":"Н н"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"О о","Name":"о","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[o]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">m<b>o</b>re</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">окно́</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ɐkˈno]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">window</span>","Word":"окно"},"id":"u_ruabc_16","type":"ru-abc","key":"О о"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"П п","Name":"пэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[p] or [pʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>p</b>et</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">па́па</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈpapə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">dad, daddy</span>","Word":"папа"},"id":"u_ruabc_17","type":"ru-abc","key":"П п"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Р р","Name":"эр","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[r] or [rʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">rolled <b>r</b></span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">ры́ба</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈrɨbə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">fish (as a living animal)</span>","Word":"рыба"},"id":"u_ruabc_18","type":"ru-abc","key":"Р р"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"С с","Name":"эс","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[s] or [sʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>s</b>et</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">сок</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[sok]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">juice</span>","Word":"сок"},"id":"u_ruabc_19","type":"ru-abc","key":"С с"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Т т","Name":"тэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[t] or [tʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>t</b>op</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">там</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[tam]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">there</span>","Word":"там"},"id":"u_ruabc_20","type":"ru-abc","key":"Т т"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"У у","Name":"у","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[u]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">t<b>oo</b>l</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">у́тро</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈutrə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">morning</span>","Word":"утро"},"id":"u_ruabc_21","type":"ru-abc","key":"У у"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ф ф","Name":"эф","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[f] or [fʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>f</b>ace</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">фами́лия</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[fɐˈmʲilʲɪjə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">surname, last name, family name</span>","Word":"фамилия"},"id":"u_ruabc_22","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ф ф"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Х х","Name":"ха","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[x] or [xʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">like Scottish \"lo<b>ch</b>\", u<b>gh</b></span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">хлеб</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[xlʲep]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">bread</span>","Word":"хлеб"},"id":"u_ruabc_23","type":"ru-abc","key":"Х х"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ц ц","Name":"цэ","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[t͡s]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">si<b>ts</b></span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">центр</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[t͡sɛntr]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">center, centre</span>","Word":"центр"},"id":"u_ruabc_24","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ц ц"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ч ч","Name":"че","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[t͡ɕ] or [tʃ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>ch</b>eck</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">чай</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[t͡ɕæj]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">tea (in all senses: the drink, the plant, the dried leaves, or tea-drinking)</span>","Word":"чай"},"id":"u_ruabc_25","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ч ч"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ш ш","Name":"ша","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ʂ] or [ʃ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">similar to \"sh\" in hu<b>sh</b></span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">шко́ла</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈʂkoɫə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">school</span>","Word":"школа"},"id":"u_ruabc_26","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ш ш"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Щ щ","Name":"ща","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ɕː], [ɕ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">similar to a long \"sh\" as in pu<b>sh sh</b>ips or a short \"sh\" as in sheep</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">ещё</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[(j)ɪˈɕːɵ]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">yet, more</span>","Word":"ещё"},"id":"u_ruabc_27","type":"ru-abc","key":"Щ щ"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ъ ъ","Name":"твёрдый знак","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[∅]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">silent, prevents palatalization of the preceding consonant</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">съесть</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[sjesʲtʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">to eat</span>","Word":"съесть"},"id":"u_ruabc_28","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ъ ъ"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ы ы","Name":"ы","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ɨ] or [i]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">General American ros<b>e</b>s (rough equivalent)</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">мы</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[mɨ]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">we</span>","Word":"мы"},"id":"u_ruabc_29","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ы ы"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ь ь","Name":"мягкий знак","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">silent, palatalizes the preceding consonant (if phonologically possible)</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">день</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[dʲenʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">day, daytime</span>","Word":"день"},"id":"u_ruabc_30","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ь ь"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Э э","Name":"э","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ɛ] or [e]</span><span class=\"uc-like\">m<b>e</b>t</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">э́то</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ˈɛtə]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">this, that</span>","Word":"это"},"id":"u_ruabc_31","type":"ru-abc","key":"Э э"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Ю ю","Name":"ю","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ju] or [ʲu]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>u</b>se or <b>you</b>th</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">ию́нь</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ɪˈjʉnʲ]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">June</span>","Word":"июнь"},"id":"u_ruabc_32","type":"ru-abc","key":"Ю ю"},{"sub":"","fields":{"Letter":"Я я","Name":"я","Sound":"<span class=\"uc-ipa\">[ja] or [ʲa]</span><span class=\"uc-like\"><b>ya</b>rd</span>","Example":"<span class=\"uc-ex\">я</span><span class=\"uc-ri\">[ja]</span><span class=\"uc-exe\">I</span>","Word":"я"},"id":"u_ruabc_33","type":"ru-abc","key":"Я я"}],"gloss":{}}